### ===== NOTE CRUD TESTS =====

### Create Note
POST http://localhost:3001/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "tiptap Note",
  "content": "<h1>this is a note for testing tiptap</h1>"
}

### ===== VIDEO PROPERTIES TESTS =====

### 1. Create Note with Video Properties
POST http://localhost:3001/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Learn Rubik's Cube",
  "content": "<p>Tutorial on solving Rubik's Cube</p>",
  "tags": ["video", "tutorial"],
  "videoUrl": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=test123",
  "videoItems": [
    { "time": 150, "note": "this is important" },
    { "time": 379, "note": "this is also important" }
  ]
}

### 2. Get Note and Verify Video Properties Saved
GET http://localhost:3001/api/notes/6a00351bbc1ebad498a6c629
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Update Note with New Video Properties
PUT http://localhost:3001/api/notes/6a00351bbc1ebad498a6c629
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "videoUrl": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=updated456",
  "videoItems": [
    { "time": 0, "note": "Opening" },
    { "time": 120, "note": "Layer 1" },
    { "time": 300, "note": "Layer 2" },
    { "time": 500, "note": "Conclusion" }
  ]
}

### 4. Get Updated Note to Verify Changes
GET http://localhost:3001/api/notes/6a00351bbc1ebad498a6c629
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Create Note Without Video Properties (Test Defaults)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Regular Note Without Video",
  "content": "<p>No video content here</p>",
  "tags": ["test"]
}

### Get All Notes
GET http://localhost:3001/api/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Single Note
GET http://localhost:3001/api/notes/69cf159a9a5d25c36f0d0c1f
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update Note
PUT http://localhost:3001/api/notes/69cf159a9a5d25c36f0d0c1f
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Updated Title",
  "content": "<p>Updated</p>"
}

### Delete Note
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/notes/REPLACE_WITH_NOTE_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

