Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===== TODO CRUD TESTS =====

### Create Todo (without note)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "content": "Buy groceries"
}

### Create Todo (with note - replace noteId with actual note ID)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "content": "second todo"
}

### Get All Todos
GET http://localhost:3001/api/todos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update Todo (mark as completed)
PUT http://localhost:3001/api/todos/69e049ef97070af53706a562
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "completed": true
}

### Update Todo (edit content)
PUT http://localhost:3001/api/todos/69e049ef97070af53706a562
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "content": "Updated todo content"
}

### Delete Todo
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/todos/69e049ef97070af53706a562
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

